      "description": "Glass pill, used over photos.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-c-photo\"><button class=\"ds-c-btn2\">Escribir por WhatsApp <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-c-photo{padding:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7a9c8a,#2F6F92 50%,#C49A4E)}.ds-c-btn2{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(28px);backdrop-filter:blur(28px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.85);box-shadow:0 16px 40px -12px rgba(23,51,61,.10);color:#18323D;font:600 15px/1 Archivo,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}.ds-c-btn2:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}.ds-c-btn2:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #18323D;outline-offset:3px}"
