      "refersTo": "fusion-tarjeta-revelado",
      "description": "Plate split by the glass handle: cyanotype left, colour right; ficha below. Rest Color.",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-c-plate\"><div class=\"ds-c-img\"><div class=\"ds-c-cyan\"></div><span class=\"ds-c-asa\"></span></div><figcaption><i></i><b>Páramo de Chingaza</b><small>4°31′N 73°45′O · 3.650 m</small></figcaption></figure>",
      "css": ".ds-c-plate{margin:0;width:260px;background:#F4F7F6;padding:12px}.ds-c-img{position:relative;height:280px;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7a9c8a,#2F6F92 50%,#C49A4E)}.ds-c-cyan{position:absolute;inset:0 100% 0 0;background:inherit;filter:grayscale(1) sepia(1) hue-rotate(170deg) saturate(2.2);transition:right .4s ease-out}.ds-c-plate:hover .ds-c-cyan{right:42%}.ds-c-asa{position:absolute;top:50%;left:100%;width:48px;height:48px;margin:-24px 0 0 -24px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(28px);backdrop-filter:blur(28px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.85);box-shadow:0 16px 40px -12px rgba(23,51,61,.10);opacity:0;transition:left .4s ease-out,opacity .2s}.ds-c-plate:hover .ds-c-asa{left:58%;opacity:1}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-c-cyan,.ds-c-asa{transition:none}}.ds-c-plate figcaption{display:grid;grid-template-columns:10px 1fr;column-gap:8px;row-gap:4px;align-items:center;padding-top:10px}.ds-c-plate i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#4C8667}.ds-c-plate b{font:500 16px/1.2 Archivo,sans-serif;color:#18323D}.ds-c-plate small{grid-column:2;font:400 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#4A626C}"
    },
